{"text": "Surprised and uneasy, Hauchecorne swallowed his drink and followed the officer to the mayors office. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mayor, a large, serious man, told him that someone had seen him pick up the lost pocketbook. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Hauchecorne asked who had said such a thing, the mayor answered, Monsieur Malandain, the harness maker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Red with anger, the old man pulled the string from his pocket and showed it to the mayor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He saw me pick up this string, and that is the reason why I bent down, he cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mayor shook his head and said that an honest man like Malandain would never mistake a string for a pocketbook. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hauchecorne raised his hand and swore on his honor, speaking as if God himself were listening. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mayor added that he had searched the mud for a long time, looking for coins that had fallen out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Malandain was brought in and repeated his story, and the two men argued angrily for a whole hour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They searched Hauchecorne at his own request but found nothing, so the puzzled mayor let him go for now.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "u", "r", "p", "r", "i", "s", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "u", "n", "e", "a", "s", "y", ",", " ", "H", "a", "u", "c", "h", "e", "c", "o", "r", "n", "e", " ", "s", "w", "a", "l", "l", "o", "w", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "d", "r", "i", "n", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "l", "l", "o", "w", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "y", "o", "r", "s", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "y", "o", "r", ",", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", "e", ",", " ", "s", "e", "r", "i", "o", "u", "s",